<title>GERMANY: German Bund futures end week higher.</title>
<headline>German Bund futures end week higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>1612 GMT - Bund futures end higher with help from other European bond markets. Market focused on Ecofin meeting this weekend and next week's Fed meeting.</p>
<p>* 6.25% April 2006 Bund 100.72, yld 6.14 pct (100.49)</p>
<p>* Dec Bund future 98.27 (98.04),range so far 98.08-98.33</p>
</text>
